## Model card (identity resolution)

- **Name:** Qwen 3.8 325B (`qwen-3.8-325b`) — **no released Qwen model matches this name.** The Qwen 3.8 generation's actual members are:
  - **Qwen3.8-Max** (2026-08-03) — 2.4T parameters, 95B active, 1M context; open-weights release Aug 2026 gated at $50M revenue (developersdigest, wealthengine, edgeX);
  - **Qwen3.8-Max-0902** (upgrade, Alibaba Cloud Facebook);
