  - **Qwen3.8-Flash-Next / Flash / Plus** (latent.space, BenchLM ledger).
  No 325B member exists at any point in the lineup.
- **Likely contamination source:** **Qwen2.5-Max (January 2025) was a 325B-parameter MoE** — the only "325B" figure ever attached to a Qwen model (thenewschannel substack, ESGenius table: "Qwen Qwen2.5-Max 22B† (MoE 325B)"). The slug appears to graft that 2025 param count onto the 2026 Qwen3.8 brand.
